    "name": "Paylocity Integrations REST Background Check Company API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Paylocity Integrations API exposes employees, demographics, status, pay rates, earnings, deductions, local/state taxes, onboarding, payroll history, time and labor, scheduling, learning management, background check, and custom-field data. Authentication uses OAuth 2.0 client credentials issued by Paylocity. API hosts include api.paylocity.com (production) and a sandbox tenant provided after partner approval.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Paylocity Developer Portal",
